Comment: Generated at build time by build-icons.sh, which recolours the
 places/ folder icons of these two upstream icon themes per profile. Only the
 folder art is overridden — everything else is inherited from the installed
 Yaru / Mint-Y-Yaru packages at runtime (see Depends in packaging/control.in).

